WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Okay,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.000
a number series!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:10.633
Three,

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:11.233
six,

00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:11.833
twelve,

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:12.433
twenty-four,

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:13.633
and then...

00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:15.433
what comes next?

00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:16.033
A.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:16.667
Thirty-six,

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:17.267
B.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:17.867
Forty-eight,

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:18.467
C.

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:19.067
Thirty,

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:20.267
or D.

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:20.867
Forty-two?

00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:22.067
Five seconds!

00:00:27.867 --> 00:00:29.067
TIME'S UP!

00:00:29.733 --> 00:00:31.600
The answer is...

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:32.233
B,

00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:32.833
forty-eight!

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:34.700
Each number doubles:

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.333
three,

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:35.967
six,

00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:36.567
twelve,

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:37.200
twenty-four,

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.933
so twenty-four times two is forty-eight.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:42.500
So,

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.533
are you smart or fart?

00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:46.967
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:48.167
find your rank!

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:49.667
So,

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:51.067
how did you do?

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.433
Comment your score below,

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:53.800
and follow for more!
